{"event":"task_created","task":{"id":"6ebc5a7c-6e11-4494-a385-98d04982c449","ticket_key":"AF-20","slug":"reserve-the-eight-aerofoil-crate-names-on-crates-io-at-0-1-0-alpha-1-6ebc5a","title":"Reserve the eight aerofoil crate names on crates.io at 0.1.0-alpha.1","description":"All eight names returned 404 on the crates.io API on 2026-11-04 and are free. Run scripts/reserve-namespaces.sh check, then scaffold, then publish --yes with credentials present. Requires the ADR-0007 decision first: the publishing account owns every crate it creates.","kind":"feature","status":"ready","priority":1,"scope":{"repo":"aerofoil","crate_name":null,"module_path":null,"target_files":["scripts/reserve-namespaces.sh"],"target_symbols":[],"labels":["release,namespaces"]},"edges":[],"decisions":[],"acceptance_criteria":["all eight names return 200 on the crates.io API; each carries 0.1.0-alpha.1 with description and license; each README marks it a placeholder and links the repository; each placeholder is yanked once the real crate publishes beta"],"plan":null,"active_claim":null,"latest_handoff":null,"verification_receipt":null,"created_at_epoch_ms":1793820883594,"updated_at_epoch_ms":1793820883594}}
{"event":"task_created","task":{"id":"d676e8d5-17eb-43a7-8d4e-f98275b1cb46","ticket_key":"AF-21","slug":"move-the-aerofoil-remote-under-its-long-term-owner-d676e8","title":"Move the aerofoil remote under its long-term owner","description":"The aerofoil org handle is taken by a user account created 2023-12-27, so an org of that name is impossible. Either the repository stays under gaugeblock (already declared in Cargo.toml) or a second-choice handle is chosen. Depends on the ADR-0007 decision.","kind":"tech_debt","status":"ready","priority":3,"scope":{"repo":"aerofoil","crate_name":null,"module_path":null,"target_files":[],"target_symbols":[],"labels":["release,github"]},"edges":[],"decisions":[],"acceptance_criteria":["Cargo.toml repository URL matches the final owner; the old remote URL redirects; crates.io owners include the long-term owner"],"plan":null,"active_claim":null,"latest_handoff":null,"verification_receipt":null,"created_at_epoch_ms":1793820883623,"updated_at_epoch_ms":1793820883623}}
{"event":"decision_raised","task_id":"6ebc5a7c-6e11-4494-a385-98d04982c449","decision":{"decision_id":"700becc8-adab-497b-9579-e4edeb6ebd4a","parent_decision_id":null,"status":"pending","category":"release","question":"Which account owns the aerofoil namespaces, and therefore who publishes first? Decided by ADR-0007; recommended: gaugeblock org for the repo, publish from the maintainer account now and add the long-term owner as a crates.io owner. Flip ADR-0007 to Accepted in the same commit as the decision.","proposed_options":["gaugeblock organisation for the repo, crates published from the maintainer account","personal account (colinwolff) for both, transfer later","new organisation with a second-choice handle, since aerofoil is taken on GitHub","defer reservations until the first beta (leaves all eight names exposed)"],"chosen_option":null,"rationale":null,"resolved_by":null,"updated_at_epoch_ms":1793820906458},"timestamp_ms":1793820906458}
