{"event":"decision_resolved","task_id":"6ebc5a7c-6e11-4494-a385-98d04982c449","decision_id":"700becc8-adab-497b-9579-e4edeb6ebd4a","chosen_option":"personal account (colinwolff) for both, transfer later","rationale":"The eight crate names are free now and only publishing holds them; the GitHub handle aerofoil is taken by a user account, so an organisation cannot claim it. Ownership is mutable in both systems (cargo owner add/remove, GitHub transfer with redirects) while a name published by someone else is not recoverable, so holding under the maintainer account now costs nothing strategically. The gaugeblock organisation was excluded as out of scope for this project. The long-term handle stays open as ADR-0008.","resolved_by":"colinwolff","spawned_followup":null,"appended_criterion":null,"timestamp_ms":1793821860564}
